{
  "id": "npc_luping",
  "title": "陆平对话",
  "description": "玄霜宗守门弟子陆平的日常对话",
  "start_node": "greeting",
  "metadata": {
    "npc_id": "luping",
    "npc_name": "陆平",
    "location": "玄霜宗山门"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "speaker": "luping",
      "text": "来者请止步！玄霜宗外门重地，需验明身份方可入内……啊，原来是近来名声渐起的那位少侠，失礼了。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_rules",
          "text": "玄霜宗有何规矩？",
          "next_node": "sect_rules"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_ask_daily",
          "text": "守门辛苦吗？",
          "next_node": "daily_talk",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": "luping",
              "value": 10,
              "operator": ">="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "choice_leave",
          "text": "告辞",
          "next_node": "farewell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sect_rules",
      "speaker": "luping",
      "text": "外门弟子需恪守三条：一不得擅闯后山禁地，二不得私斗伤人，三需按时完成宗门杂役。若能攒够贡献、通过考核，便有晋升内门之望。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "luping",
          "value": 2,
          "reason": "认真了解宗门规矩"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "daily_talk",
      "speaker": "luping",
      "text": "说辛苦也辛苦，风雨无阻嘛。不过守在这山门前，能见到各路高人进出，耳濡目染也是修行。我呀，就盼着哪天也能通过传功长老的考核，进内门真正学剑。",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "relationship_change",
          "target": "luping",
          "value": 3,
          "reason": "倾听陆平的心愿"
        }
      ],
      "next_node": "farewell"
    },
    {
      "id": "farewell",
      "speaker": "luping",
      "text": "少侠慢走。山中妖兽时有出没，夜路多加小心。",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "is_end": true
    }
  ]
}
